{{!
    @template mod_ep/actions

    Boutons d'action d'une ligne de liste, ou un tiret s'il n'y en a aucun.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * actions - Liste de {label, url, class}.
    * empty - Texte affiché sans action.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "actions": [
            {"label": "View details", "url": "https://example.com/mod/ep/dashboard.php?id=3&studentid=5", "class": "btn btn-sm btn-secondary mr-1 mb-1"}
        ],
        "empty": "-"
    }
}}
{{#actions}}
<a href="{{url}}" class="{{class}}">{{label}}</a>
{{/actions}}
{{^actions}}{{empty}}{{/actions}}
